 We have the palomino interior, which looks very nice on here.

5
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,860
 A little bit larger of an ES for the 2026 model year.

6
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:31,440
 Of course, this is a fully redesigned inside and out.

7
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:35,380
 It's available as an EV or as this 350h hybrid.

8
00:00:35,380 --> 00:00:37,620
 This is the front-wheel drive model.

9
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:40,300
 You can also get the hybrid in all-wheel drive.

10
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:46,260
 As specced, this gets about 48 miles per gallon on the highway, about 44 in the city, 46 combined,

11
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:53,180
 which is an amazing fuel economy, 244 net combined horsepower, and a completely new

12
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:54,460
 interior and exterior.

13
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:58,220
 Let's walk you guys around it, talk about what it's been like to spend the first 30,

